{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["赞美之歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["到那日，你们必说：",{"text":"“耶和华啊，我要赞美你！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你虽然曾向我发怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你的怒气已经止息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你还安慰了我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"“看啊，上帝是我的拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要倚靠祂，不会惧怕。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华上帝是我的力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我的诗歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂成了我的拯救者。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必从救恩的泉源欢然取水。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那日，你们必说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“要称颂耶和华，求告祂的名；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要在万民中传扬祂的作为，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宣告祂的名配受尊崇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"“耶和华成就了奇妙的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要向祂歌唱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将祂的作为传遍世界。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"锡安的居民啊，高声欢呼吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为住在你们当中的以色列的圣者无比伟大。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}